cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Formalizing triangle tiling in Lean"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-22"
authors:
  - family-names: Bonfioli
    given-names: Vico
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of results on tilings of polygons and triangles by congruent and similar
  triangles (Laczkovich, Beeson, Beeson-Zhang, Zhang, Snover-Waiveris-Williams), with coverage tables and
  a document of printed gaps found while formalizing. All theorems are unaudited by anyone outside the project.
keywords:
  - triangle tiling
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
license: CC-BY-4.0
